{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02488","headline":"晚别乐记室彦 · 褚亮","name":"晚别乐记室彦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穷途属岁晚，临水忽分悲。\n抱影同爲客，伤情共此时。\n雾色侵虚牖，霜氛冷薄帷。\n举袂惨将别，停杯怅不怡。\n风严征雁远，雪暗去篷迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02488.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02488","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}